{"dialogue": {"lines": [{"en": "Hello doctor. I have a fever.", "hi": "नमस्कार डॉक्टर साहब। मुझे बुख़ार है।", "r": "Nomoshkar ḍaktarbabu. Amar jor eshechhe.", "sp": "Patient", "t": "নমস্কার ডাক্তারবাবু। আমার জ্বর এসেছে।"}, {"en": "Fever since when?", "hi": "कब से बुख़ार?", "r": "Kobe theke jor?", "sp": "Doctor", "t": "কবে থেকে জ্বর?"}, {"en": "For two days. With a headache too.", "hi": "दो दिन से। साथ में सिरदर्द भी है।", "r": "Dudin dhore. Shonge mathabyathao achhe.", "sp": "Patient", "t": "দুদিন ধরে। সঙ্গে মাথাব্যথাও আছে।"}, {"en": "Show me your tongue. Yes, the throat is red.", "hi": "ज़बान दिखाइए। हाँ, गला लाल है।", "r": "Jibhta dekhan. Hyan, gola lal hoye achhe.", "sp": "Doctor", "t": "জিভটা দেখান। হ্যাঁ, গলা লাল হয়ে আছে।"}, {"en": "Take these medicines twice a day after meals.", "hi": "ये दवाएँ खाने के बाद दिन में दो बार लीजिएगा।", "r": "Ei oshudhghulo khaoar pore dine dubar khaben.", "sp": "Doctor", "t": "এই ওষুধগুলো খাওয়ার পরে দিনে দুবার খাবেন।"}, {"en": "Thank you, doctor.", "hi": "धन्यवाद डॉक्टर साहब।", "r": "Dhonnobad ḍaktarbabu.", "sp": "Patient", "t": "ধন্যবাদ ডাক্তারবাবু।"}], "title": "At the doctor's"}, "lede": "Body parts, symptoms, hospitals and medicines — the Bengali you need when health matters.", "phrases": [{"en": "I am sick", "hi": "मैं बीमार हूँ", "r": "Amar shorir kharap", "t": "আমার শরীর খারাপ"}, {"en": "I have a fever", "hi": "मुझे बुख़ार है", "r": "Amar jor eshechhe", "t": "আমার জ্বর এসেছে"}, {"en": "My head aches", "hi": "मेरे सिर में दर्द है", "r": "Amar matha dhorechhe", "t": "আমার মাথা ধরেছে"}, {"en": "Call a doctor", "hi": "डॉक्टर को बुलाइए", "r": "Ḍaktar ḍakun", "t": "ডাক্তার ডাকুন"}, {"en": "Where is the hospital?", "hi": "अस्पताल कहाँ है?", "r": "Haspatal kothay?", "t": "হাসপাতাল কোথায়?"}, {"en": "I need medicine", "hi": "मुझे दवा चाहिए", "r": "Amar oshudh dorkar", "t": "আমার ওষুধ দরকার"}, {"en": "Twice a day after meals", "hi": "खाने के बाद दिन में दो बार", "r": "Khaoar pore dine dubar", "t": "খাওয়ার পরে দিনে দুবার"}, {"en": "Drink more water", "hi": "ज़्यादा पानी पिएँ", "r": "Beshi kore jol khan", "t": "বেশি করে জল খান"}, {"en": "Take rest", "hi": "आराम कीजिए", "r": "Bishram nin", "t": "বিশ্রাম নিন"}, {"en": "Don't worry, you'll be fine", "hi": "चिंता न करें, ठीक हो जाएँगे", "r": "Chinta korben na, bhalo hoye jaben", "t": "চিন্তা করবেন না, ভালো হয়ে যাবেন"}, {"en": "Since when?", "hi": "कब से?", "r": "Kobe theke?", "t": "কবে থেকে?"}, {"en": "Show me your tongue", "hi": "अपनी ज़बान दिखाइए", "r": "Jibhta dekhan", "t": "জিভটা দেখান"}], "quiz": [{"a": "fever", "explain": "জ্বর (jor) = fever — আমার জ্বর এসেছে (I have a fever).", "id": "bq-25", "lesson": "health", "level": "beginner", "opts": ["fever", "cold", "cough", "pain"], "q": "জ্বর means…", "topic": "health", "type": "vocab"}, {"a": "মাথা", "explain": "মাথা (matha) = head — মাথাব্যথা is a headache.", "id": "bq-26", "lesson": "health", "level": "beginner", "opts": ["মাথা", "পেট", "হাত", "পা"], "q": "Which is 'head'?", "topic": "health", "type": "vocab"}, {"a": "my head aches", "explain": "আমার মাথা ধরেছে — literally 'my head has caught (pain)'.", "id": "bq-27", "lesson": "health", "level": "beginner", "opts": ["my head aches", "my stomach aches", "I feel dizzy", "I feel cold"], "q": "'আমার মাথা ধরেছে' means…", "topic": "health", "type": "meaning"}, {"a": "ডাক্তার ডাকুন", "explain": "ডাক্তার ডাকুন = call a doctor. ওষুধ দিন = give medicine.", "id": "bq-28", "lesson": "health", "level": "elementary", "opts": ["ডাক্তার ডাকুন", "ওষুধ দিন", "বিল দিন", "চিন্তা করবেন না"], "q": "You need a doctor. You say…", "topic": "health", "type": "usage"}, {"a": "medicine", "explain": "ওষুধ (oshudh) = medicine — আমার ওষুধ দরকার (I need medicine).", "id": "bq-29", "lesson": "health", "level": "beginner", "opts": ["medicine", "injection", "bandage", "syrup"], "q": "ওষুধ means…", "topic": "health", "type": "vocab"}, {"a": "hospital", "explain": "হাসপাতাল (haspatal) = hospital; ক্লিনিক = clinic; ফার্মেসি = pharmacy.", "id": "bq-30", "lesson": "health", "level